----------------------------------------------------------------------------
yet-another-monochrome-icon-set (YAMIS) is created by Dirn.
https://bitbucket.org/dirn-typo/yet-another-monochrome-icon-set

Folder shapes are from the Tela icon theme by vinceliuice.
https://github.com/vinceliuice/Tela-icon-theme

Additional app glyphs derived from the Papirus icon theme and GNOME
Adwaita/hicolor, and from each upstream app's Flathub icon (ownership
reserved to the respective projects).

See README.md for the full source & license notes.
